{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, then take it and check properties. If task is done, move to next location. Find object otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsTaskComplete    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
